1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:08,293
This walkthrough uses real Playdate and Hub captures. Narration and the
demonstration speech are synthesized. Waiting periods are edited.

2
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:21,306
Build Evener in setup-only mode with your own OpenAI key. Keep that
bundle private. Use USB Data Disk mode to copy Evener dot P D X into
Games, then eject and open it.

3
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:29,905
Open Receive setup. On an existing installation, find it under Actions
in the system menu.

4
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:39,011
In the Hub, open Settings, Mobile app, then Pair using sound. Check the
Hub address, choose Tailscale, and create an invitation.

5
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:46,713
Play the setup sound beside your Playdate.

6
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:53,830
[Actual setup sound recorded beside the Playdate]

7
00:00:55,700 --> 00:01:05,438
If enrollment is needed, scan the Tailscale code on the Playdate. On
your phone, sign in and authorize the device on the Hub’s tailnet. Phone
approval was not recorded.

8
00:01:09,700 --> 00:01:17,698
This approval example is from an earlier take. Compare all four lines on
your own screens. When every group matches, approve in the Hub.

9
00:01:25,700 --> 00:01:28,940
The Hub confirms approval. Keep the Playdate connected.

10
00:01:31,700 --> 00:01:37,977
Review the destination on the Playdate, then press A to save it. The
client connects and opens your sessions.

11
00:01:41,700 --> 00:01:45,778
Select a session with the crank or D-pad, then press A to open it.

12
00:01:47,700 --> 00:01:52,085
Hold A and start speaking immediately. The microphone captures your
words.

13
00:01:53,700 --> 00:02:00,743
Release A to finish recording. Wait for the final text to be saved, then
read it. The message has not been sent yet.

14
00:02:08,700 --> 00:02:13,667
Press A separately to send the reviewed message. An active session
receives it in its queue.

15
00:02:16,700 --> 00:02:22,935
The reply appears in the conversation. Use the crank to read through it.
This is the recorded test exchange.

16
00:02:25,700 --> 00:02:31,668
The README has the build instructions and current limitations. Evener
for Playdate, from Prime Radiant.
